      "index": 0,
      "text": "673,326.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **674** and **999**, we can use the distributive property of multiplication to simplify the calculation.\n\n### Step-by-Step Solution:\n\n1. **Break down 999**:\n   \n   \\[\n   999 = 1000 - 1\n   \\]\n\n2. **Apply the distributive property**:\n   \n   \\[\n   674 \\times 999 = 674 \\times (1000 - 1)\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 674 by each part**:\n   \n   \\[\n   674 \\times 1000 = 674,\\!000\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   674 \\times 1 = 674\n   \\]\n\n4. **Subtract the two results**:\n   \n   \\[\n   674,\\!000 - 674 = 673,\\!326\n   \\]\n\n### Final Answer:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{673,\\!326}\n\\]",
